  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Theia** (1 other source): Alternate rock version played for first time, featuring Land Before Timeland and Wah Wah teases [1]\n- **Wah Wah** (1 other source): Included River intro, quotes, teases, plus Crumbling Castle and Motor Spirit teases and quotes [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Oddlife**: back after 89 archived shows (808 days) [3]\n- **The Silver Cord**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-05-24.Spain2025N2** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 119 min [1]\n- **kglw2025-05-24.SBD.flac**: soundboard; 0 songs; 119 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Poble Espanyol and its staff hosted the recording session [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-05-24.Spain2025N2**: taped by Jamie Downsworth; transferred by Tora Tapes; source: Sony PCM D50 [1]\n- **kglw2025-05-24.SBD.flac**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, Grace Reader, Gaspard De Meulemeester; source: SBD [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by RobinPlaceFabrics: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Poble Espanyol May 24, 2025 Show Poster Shirt - RobinPlaceFabrics](https://robinplacefabrics.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-poble-espanyol-may-24-2025-show-poster-shirt) [4]",
